<title>UK: Caspian says Launders resigns from Leeds Utd.</title>
<headline>Caspian says Launders resigns from Leeds Utd.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Caspian Group Plc, owner of Leeds United football club, said on Monday that Robin Launders resigned as a director of Caspian and chief executive of Leeds, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Caspian said its finance director, Jeremy Fenn, had been named managing director of Leeds United.</p>
<p>Caspian bought Leeds last year in a reverse takeover.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
